From cedf9c528b1417c3ba645d71084d914d572d9291 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CosmosEx Buildroot <4372835+planeturban@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 18:08:16 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Rename the CosmosEx's own storage /pi to /storage

The partition was mounted at /pi, after the user, which says nothing about
what it is. Now /storage: translated drives, downloaded images, hard disk
images. The sharing settings (section "pishare") become "storageshare",
with the tool /usr/sbin/ce-storageshare and /etc/ce-storageshare.conf.
